e to use around children and pets.</span></p></li><li style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; text-wrap-mode: nowrap;\"><p style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">Long-Lasting</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\">: Provides extended protection, reducing the need for frequent reapplication.</span></p></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">This product is perfect for stainless steel appliances, kitchen countertops, glass, and more. It's an excellent choice for anyone looking to maintain a spotless and shiny home with minimal effort.</span></p></div>",
